The Sith Lords [[Revan|Darth Revan]] and [[Darth Bane]] were slated to make appearances as advisors to the [[Son]], but were cut late in production.<ref name="GoMFeaturette">{{SW|url=video/ghosts-of-mortis-episode-featurette|text="Ghosts of Mortis" Episode Featurette}}</ref> Darth Bane appeared in the later episode "[[Sacrifice (episode)|Sacrifice]]," but with an entirely redone character design, which is his current [[canon]]ical appearance.<ref name="Sacrifice">{{TCW|Sacrifice (episode)}}</ref>

